    "title": "MICROSERVICE_BETA_Hotel Room Availability Check API",
    "description": "The Hotel Room Availability Check API enables users to determine the availability of hotel rooms for specified dates and criteria. This endpoint allows travel agents, booking platforms, and hotel management systems to assess room availability efficiently. Users can submit specific parameters such as check-in and check-out dates, room types, and occupancy levels to receive real-time availability information. This functionality is essential for making informed booking decisions and enhancing the user experience in the hospitality sector.",
